# The sandbox's Python packages (the venv /opt/py): what Claude uses for documents, PDFs, spreadsheets, charts and
# Chinese text, and yt-dlp for video from a link. requirements.txt pins each, and everything they pull in, by version
# and sha256; tools/sandbox-image moves the pins (`pip install --require-hashes`).
pandas
openpyxl
xlsxwriter
python-docx
python-pptx
matplotlib
pypdf
pdfplumber
beautifulsoup4
lxml
requests
httpx
Pillow
markdown
tabulate
python-dateutil
chardet
opencc-python-reimplemented
weasyprint
# 1.x: 2.0 pulls onnxruntime, networkx and pymupdf4llm (+100 MB compressed)
pymupdf<2
reportlab
yt-dlp[default]
